ter gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Кой как гласува, закони, партии, депутати\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/parlament\">Парламент</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Какво обещаха правителствата и какво стана\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/obeshtaniya\">Обещания</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Вярно ли е казаното, корупционни дела\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/proverki\">Проверки</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-px h-4 bg-white/20\"></span><a title=\"Приходи, разходи, дълг\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/byudzhet\">Бюджет</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Договори, фирми, риск, връзки с политици\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/porachki\">Поръчки</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Растеж, инфлация, заплати, жилища\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/ikonomika\">Икономика</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Цените в магазините по вериги и места\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/ceni\">Цени</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-px h-4 bg-white/20\"></span><a title=\"Вашата община: пари, поръчки, съвет\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/mesta\">Места</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-px h-4 bg-white/20\"></span><a title=\"Графики с източник за всичко\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/statistiki\">Статистики</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Заплата, кредит, лична инфлация\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/kalkulatori\">Калкулатори</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Какво е ново в данните\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/novini\">Новини</a></span></nav><div class=\"ml-auto flex items-center gap-1\"><a aria-label=\"Търсене\" class=\"no-underline text-white hover:text-white p-2 rounded hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/tarsene\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><circle cx=\"10.5\" cy=\"10.5\" r=\"6.5\"></circle><path d=\"m20 20-4.8-4.8\"></path></svg></a><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-menu\" class=\"lg:hidden flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 rounded bg-white/10 text-[15px] font-semibold\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative w-4 h-3\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white transition top-0\"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1.5 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white \"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white transition top-3\"></span></span>Меню</button></div></div></header><!--/$--><main class=\"flex-1 min-h-[100svh]\"><div class=\"mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-12 max-w-[88rem]\"><div class=\"relative left-1/2 right-1/2 -ml-[50vw] -mr-[50vw] w-screen bg-surface -mt-8 sm:-mt-12 mb-10\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[88rem] px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-12\"><p class=\"text-[15px] text-green font-semibold mb-2\">Калкулатор</p><h1 class=\"display text-5xl sm:text-7xl max-w-4xl\">Нужен доход</h1><div class=\"mt-3 text-lg text-muted max-w-3xl\">Каква заплата ви трябва, за да живеете така, както искате, и колко да отделяте за пенсията.</div></div></div><div class=\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,5fr)_minmax(0,7fr)]\"><div class=\"space-y-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">Стойностите по подразбиране са само пример. Сменете ги с вашите реални разходи на месец за цялото домакинство.</p><div class=\"divide-y divide-rule\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1fr_8.5rem] gap-3 items-center py-2\"><span class=\"text-[15px]\">Наем или вноска по кредит</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><input type=\"number\" inputMode=\"decimal\" step=\"10\" min=\"0\" value=\"500\"/><span class=\"text-muted text-sm whitespace-nowrap\">€</span></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1fr_8.5rem] gap-3 items-center py-2\"><span class=\"text-[15px]\">Ток, вода, отопление, вход</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><input type=\"number\" inputMode=\"decimal\" step=\"10\" min=\"0\" value=\"150\"/><span class=\"text-muted text-sm whitespace-nowrap\">€</span></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1fr_8.5rem] gap-3 items-center py-2\"><span class=\"text-[15px]\">Храна и домакински стоки</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><input type=\"number\" inputMode=\"decimal\" step=\"10\" min=\"0\" value=\"450\"/><span class=\"text-muted text-sm whitespace-nowrap\">€</span></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1fr_8.5rem] gap-3 items-center py-2\"><span class=\"text-[15px]\">Транспорт и гориво</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><input type=\"number\" inputMode=\"decimal\" step=\"10\" min=\"0\" value=\"150\"/><span class=\"text-muted text-sm whitespace-nowrap\">€</span></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1fr_8.5rem] gap-3 items-center py-2\"><span class=\"text-[15px]\">Телефон и интернет</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><input type=\"number\" inputMode=\"decimal\" step=\"10\" min=\"0\" value=\"40\"/><span class=\"text-muted text-sm whitespace-nowrap\">€</span></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1fr_8.5rem] gap-3 items-center py-2\"><span class=\"text-[15px]\">Здраве и лекарства</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><input type=\"number\" inputMode=\"decimal\" step=\"10\" min=\"0\" value=\"50\"/><span class=\"text-muted text-sm whitespace-nowrap\">€</span></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1fr_8.5rem] gap-3 items-center py-2\"><span class=\"text-[15px]\">Деца (детска градина, занимания)</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><input type=\"number\" inputMode=\"decimal\" step=\"10\" min=\"0\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"text-muted text-sm whitespace-nowrap\">€</span></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1fr_8.5rem] gap-3 items-center py-2\"><span class=\"text-[15px]\">Ресторанти, развлечения, спорт</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><input type=\"number\" inputMode=\"decimal\" step=\"10\" min=\"0\" value=\"200\"/><span class=\"text-muted text-sm whitespace-nowrap\">€</span></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1fr_8.5rem] gap-3 items-center py-2\"><span class=\"text-[15px]\">Облекло</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><input type=\"number\" inputMode=\"decimal\" step=\"10\" min=\"0\" value=\"60\"/><span class=\"text-muted text-sm whitespace-nowrap\">€</span></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1fr_8.5rem] gap-3 items-center py-2\"><span class=\"text-[15px]\">Почивки (разпределени по месеци)</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><input type=\"number\" inputMode=\"decimal\" step=\"10\" min=\"0\" value=\"100\"/><span class=\"text-muted text-sm whitespace-nowrap\">€</span></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1fr_8.5rem] gap-3 items-center py-2\"><span class=\"text-[15px]\">Други</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><input type=\"number\" inputMode=\"decimal\" step=\"10\" min=\"0\" value=\"80\"/><span class=\"text-muted text-sm whitespace-nowrap\">€</span></div></div></div><label class=\"block\"><span class=\"block text-sm font-semibold mb-1\">Колко искате да спестявате от нетния доход</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><input type=\"number\" inputMode=\"decimal\" step=\"1\" min=\"0\" max=\"90\" value=\"10\"/><span class=\"text-muted text-sm whitespace-nowrap\">%</span></div></label><label class=\"block\"><span class=\"block text-sm font-semibold mb-1\">Колко души в домакинството работят</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><input type=\"number\" inputMode=\"decimal\" step=\"1\" min=\"1\" max=\"6\" value=\"1\"/></div></label><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold pt-4\">Пенсия</p><label class=\"block\"><span class=\"block text-sm font-semibold mb-1\">Възраст сега</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><input type=\"number\" inputMode=\"decimal\" step=\"1\" min=\"16\" max=\"80\" value=\"30\"/><span class=\"text-muted text-sm whitespace-nowrap\">г.</span></div></label><label class=\"block\"><span class=\"block text-sm font-semibold mb-1\">Възраст на пенсиониране</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><input type=\"number\" inputMode=\"decimal\" step=\"1\" min=\"40\" max=\"80\" value=\"65\"/><span class=\"text-muted text-sm whitespace-nowrap\">г.</span></div></label><label class=\"block\"><span class=\"block text-sm font-semibold mb-1\">Желан месечен доход в пенсия (днешни пари)</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><input type=\"number\" inputMode=\"decimal\" step=\"50\" min=\"0\" value=\"1200\"/><span class=\"text-muted text-sm whitespace-nowrap\">€</span></div></label><label class=\"block\"><span class=\"block text-sm font-semibold mb-1\">Очаквана държавна пенсия (днешни пари)</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><input type=\"number\" inputMode=\"decimal\" step=\"50\" min=\"0\" value=\"600\"/><span class=\"text-muted text-sm whitespace-nowrap\">€</span></div><span class=\"block text-xs text-muted mt-1\">Вашата прогноза можете да видите в личния профил в НОИ.</span></label><label class=\"block\"><span class=\"block text-sm font-semibold mb-1\">Реална доходност на спестяванията (над инфлацията)</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><input type=\"number\" inputMode=\"decimal\" step=\"0.5\" min=\"0\" value=\"5\"/><span class=\"text-muted text-sm whitespace-nowrap\">%</span></div></label></div><div class=\"bg-surface rounded-xl p-5 sm:p-7 self-start\"><div aria-live=\"polite\"><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">Нужна нетна заплата</p><p class=\"display num text-[4.2rem] mt-1\">1978 €</p><p class=\"mt-1\">Това е бруто <span class=\"num font-semibold\">2514 €</span> по трудов договор. За работодателя струва <span class=\"num\">2950 €</span>.</p><div class=\"mt-6\"><div class=\"flex justify-between gap-4 py-2 border-b border-rule \"><span>Разходи на домакинството на месец</span><span class=\"num text-right whitespace-nowrap\">1780 €</span></div><div class=\"flex justify-between gap-4 py-2 border-b border-rule \"><span>Плюс спестяване 10%</span><span class=\"num text-right whitespace-nowrap\">198 €</span></div><div class=\"flex justify-between gap-4 py-2 border-b border-rule font-bold\"><span>Нужен нетен доход на домакинството</span><span class=\"num text-right whitespace-nowrap\">1978 €</span></div><div class=\"flex justify-between gap-4 py-2 border-b border-rule \"><span>Спрямо минималната заплата (бруто)</span><span class=\"num text-right whitespace-nowrap\">4,1 пъти</span></div></div><h2 class=\"display text-[1.8rem] mt-8\">За пенсията</h2><div class=\"flex justify-between gap-4 py-2 border-b border-rule \"><span>Липсва ви на месец в пенсия</span><span class=\"num text-right whitespace-nowrap\">600 €</span></div><div class=\"flex justify-between gap-4 py-2 border-b border-rule \"><span>Нужен капитал (правило на 4% теглене годишно)</span><span class=\"num text-right whitespace-nowrap\">180 000 €</span></div><div class=\"flex justify-between gap-4 py-2 border-b border-rule font-bold\"><span>Нужна месечна вноска от днес</span><span class=\"num text-right whitespace-nowrap\">158 €</span></div><p class=\"text-sm text-muted mt-2\">Всичко е в днешни пари, затова доходността е над инфлацията. Правилото на 4% е опростено допускане от изследвания върху американски пазари.</p><details class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-muted border-t border-rule pt-3\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer text-ink\">Какво сме допуснали и откъде са числата</summary><ul class=\"mt-2 space-y-1\"><li>Осигуровки, работник<!-- -->: <span class=\"num text-ink\">13,78%</span> (пенсии 6,58 + ДЗПО 2,2 + ОЗМ 1,4 + безработица 0,4 + здравно 3,2)<!-- -->, в сила от <!-- -->1.08.2026 г.<!-- --> ·<!-- --> <a href=\"https://kik-info.com/novini/novini-i-akcenti/Ot-01082026-Osigurovki-MOD-TZPB-bolnichni.208156.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Осигуровки, МОД, ТЗПБ от 01.08.2026 (ДВ бр. 68/2026), kik-info.com</a></li><li>Данък общ доход<!-- -->: <span class=\"num text-ink\">10,00%</span>, в сила от <!-- -->1.01.2008 г.<!-- --> ·<!-- --> <a href=\"https://nra.bg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">ЗДДФЛ, чл. 48</a></li><li>Минимална заплата<!-- -->: <span class=\"num text-ink\">620,20 €/месец</span>, в сила от <!-- -->1.01.2026 г.<!-- --> ·<!-- --> <a href=\"https://nra.bg/wps/portal/nra/actualno/vpisvane_v_registura_na_zaetostta_vuv_vruzka_s_opredelenata_mrz_ot_01.01.2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">ПМС № 243 от 13.11.2025 г. (ДВ, бр. 98/2025), съобщение на НАП</a></li></ul></details><p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-4\">Скоро ще добавим средни разходи и наеми по градове от НСИ, за да имате база за сравнение.</p></div></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class=\"bg-surface border-t border-rule mt-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[88rem] px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 text-sm text-muted grid gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2\"><p>Не подкрепяме партия, кандидат или правителство. Всяко число има източник и дата.<!-- --> <a href=\"/metodologiya\">Как работим</a> · <a href=\"/rechnik\">Речник</a> · <a href=\"/sastoyanie\">Състояние на данните</a> · <!--$?--><template id=\"B:1\"></template><a href=\"/metodologiya#greshki\">Съобщи за грешка</a><!--/$--></p><p class=\"sm:text-right\">Вътрешен прототип · данните са към датите, посочени до тях</p